# Run outputs from this machine's evals and handbook builds. They record local paths, drive
# names, volume UUIDs and Drive folder links, so they stay local. Regenerate them with the
# _*.py tools; tests, tools and evals.md are the portable part.
/*-evidence/
/handbook/
/recovery.json
/general-report.md
/general-validation.json
/drive-api-report.md
__pycache__/
